      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Rato de Fogo. Cyndaquil normalmente permanece curvado. Quando fica irritado ou surpreso, lança chamas pelas costas. Esse fogo atinge sua temperatura máxima quando ele está furioso, e as labaredas intensas intimidam os inimigos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cyndaquil pode evoluir para Quilava no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Smokescreen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Flame Wheel</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Defense Curl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Flame Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Lava Plume</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Flamethrower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Inferno, Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Burn Up, Double-Edge, Overheat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Eruption</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Attract, Body Slam, Burning Jealousy, Confide, Covet, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Fang, Fire Pledge, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Frustration, Heat Wave, Hidden Power, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Nature Power, Overheat, Play Rough, Protect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Round, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Toxic, Wild Charge, Will-O-Wisp, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Covet, Crush Claw, Curse, Double Kick, Double-Edge, Extrasensory, Flame Burst, Flare Blitz, Foresight, Fury Swipes, Howl, Nature Power, Quick Attack, Reversal, Thrash</p>",
